<title>ITALY: Tech problem hits Milan's Italy bond/futures trade.</title>
<headline>Tech problem hits Milan's Italy bond/futures trade.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Technical problems blocked trading and price listing on both the screen-based Italian bond and futures market (MTS) and interbank deposit market (MID) on Monday morning.</p>
<p>SIA, the company in charge of the computerised system, was unable to say when the problems were likely to be solved.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129589</p>
